"<p>Sorry, you need to use at least one of the three tables -- <b> "
"filter, nat</b> or <b>mangle</b>:"
"<br>it does not make any sense to work on a ruleset where you cannot add any "
"rules.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Desculpe, pero debe usar polo menos unha das trés táboas: <b>filter, nat</b> "
"ou <b>mangle</b>."
"<br>Non ten nengun sentido usar un conxunto de regras onde non pode engadir "
"regras.</p>"

