#: kmfwidgets/kmfselectinterface.cpp:38
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>The generic interface provides an easy-to-use tool for setting up common "
"personal firewalls or simple network routers.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>A interface xenérica dá-lle unha ferramenta fácil de utilizar para "
"configurar devasas persoais ou enrotadores de rede simples.</p></qt>"

#: kmfwidgets/kmfselectinterface.cpp:42
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>The IPTable interface is meant to be used by advanced users who like to have "
"full control over the rules generated; as such, the IPTables interface provides "
"an almost 1-1 view on your iptables configuration.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>A interface IPTable está destinada a usuários avanzados que desexan "
"controlar totalmente as regras xeradas. A interface IPTables fornece unha vista "
"case 1 para 1 da configurazón de iptables.</p></qt>"

#: kmfwidgets/kmfselectinterface.cpp:43
msgid "IPTables Interface"
msgstr "Interface IPTables"

